 # Photos Note Discovery MVP
## End-to-End Wireframes and User Journey

**Document purpose:** describe the phone-framed Photos note and retrieval MVP as it currently behaves, from browsing and note capture through rediscovery. This is a product wireframe and journey specification, not a visual redesign.

**Product scope:** the standalone Photos prototype in `index.html`, `js/app.js`, `js/search.js`, and `css/app.css`. The separate desktop AI Detective purchase-intelligence dashboard in `src/` is a different product and is out of scope here.

**Primary user:** a person browsing a photo library who wants to attach a short memory phrase to a photo and later retrieve the photo using that phrase, its place, date, people, or related concepts.

**Core value:** capture a lightweight memory while viewing a photo, then reduce the effort required to find it again.

---

