```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Feed[Photos feed] --> Memories[Memories carousel]
    Feed --> Viewer[Photo viewer]
    Memories --> Viewer
    Viewer -->|Prompt appears after delay| NotePrompt[Add a note prompt]
    NotePrompt -->|Tap| NoteEditor[Inline note editor]
    NoteEditor -->|Save| Viewer
    Viewer -->|Info| Info[Photo information sheet]
    Info -->|Add or edit| InfoEditor[Info note editor]
    InfoEditor -->|Save| Info
    Viewer -->|Close| Feed
    Feed --> Collections[Collections]
    Collections --> Notes[Notes collection]
    Notes -->|Open photo| Viewer
    Notes -->|Edit| NotesEditor[Inline Notes editor]
    NotesEditor --> Notes
    Feed -->|Search button| Search[Search / Ask]
    Feed -->|Floating clue| ClueResults[Clue results]
    Search -->|Type, suggestion, or clue| Results[Photo results]
    ClueResults -->|Open result| Viewer
    Results -->|Open result| Viewer
    Collections --> People[People & pets]
    Collections --> Places[Places]
    Collections --> Albums[Albums]
    Collections --> Moments[Moments]
    Collections --> Categories[Documents / screenshots / favorites / trash]
    Feed --> Settings[Settings]
```

### Global Shell

```text
┌────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ PHONE STATUS BAR                        │
├────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ APP VIEWPORT                            │
│                                          │
